        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Loretta Devine, Kevin Sorbo, Cynthia Gibb, Madison De La Garza, Cassidy Gifford, Dallas Lovato\n- Works: Caged No More, Boston Public, Grey's Anatomy\n- Awards: Primetime Emmy Award for Outstanding Guest Actress in a Drama Series\n\nFacts:\n- Loretta Devine was born on August 21, 1949.\n- Loretta Devine is an American actress and singer.\n- Loretta Devine is best known for playing Marla Hendricks in the Fox drama series Boston Public.\n- In 2011, Loretta Devine won the Primetime Emmy Award for Outstanding Guest Actress in a Drama Series for her recurring role as Adele Webber on Grey's Anatomy.\n- The film Caged No More stars Kevin Sorbo, Loretta Devine, Cynthia Gibb, Madison De La Garza, Cassidy Gifford, and Dallas Lovato.",
